IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-REP-PENALTY-DECAY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-EMITTED         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 INITIAL-PENALTY     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HALF-LIFE           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 STABILIZATION-PCT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-REP-DECAY.
    IF NUM-EMITTED == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 94 TO STABILIZATION-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-EMITTED.
    WEIGHT 30 STABILIZATION-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
